🚀 Join our team as a C# Software Engineer
and contribute to the development of business-critical applications supporting Fixed Income Financing trading activities. You will work in an Agile environment, collaborating with international teams to deliver scalable, high-quality solutions using modern technologies and engineering best practices.

📌 Specifically, you will be required to:

Design and develop new features front to back as part of an agile/scrum team;
Ensure the delivery of high-quality and scalable solutions using modern development practices such as clean code, automated testing, monitoring, alerting and secure by design;
Participate in events like disaster recovery tests, releases and quarterly infra week-ends;
Provide support on application in production environment, when needed;
Drive innovation and contribute with new ideas for the existing architecture, services and processes;
Maintain and improve the continuous integration and delivery environment;
Maintain a close relationship with the international team and ensure the delivery of high quality features.

🎯 Profile:

Solid understanding of C#.NET 6.0/8.0 and OOP, RESTful, JSON, Mongo DB;
Hands-on experience with Angular JS and/or Angular, Git, unit testing & continuous integration frameworks (TeamCity, Jenkins, Sonar, NUnit, etc.);
Bachelor degree in Computer Science or equivalent;
Good command of English, both written and spoken with the ability to participate in English-only meetings.

🌟 If you are passionate about C#, enjoy solving complex problems, and want to make a direct impact on trading platforms and workflows, we would be excited to welcome you to the team.

